        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times;">Amounts</xhtml:span>
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; color: #242424;">due to customer as a result of the tax rate changes primarily related to the 2017 Tax Cuts and Job Act.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
