      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 16px;">Washington Gas Light Company is the sole shipper of the Hampshire storage facility, and is responsible for supplying all gas receipts, deliveries and gas used in operations. We operate under a cost of service tariff and we do not charge a fee based on storage volumes.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
